### Import documents
### Route: POST /api/import/documents
###
### Bulk import of markdown files via multipart/form-data. Fields:
###   files          one or more file parts (repeat the part per file)
###   target_path    optional destination folder (defaults to root)
###   overwrite_mode  "rename" (default) | "overwrite" | "skip"
###
### REST Client reads file parts relative to THIS .http file — drop the sample
### markdown files into the http/ folder or adjust the paths below.

### Import a single markdown file into /imported
POST {{apiUrl}}/import/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SchistImportBoundary

------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="target_path"

/imported
------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overwrite_mode"

rename
------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="note.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./note.md
------SchistImportBoundary--
# => 200 import result summary

### Import multiple files at once
POST {{apiUrl}}/import/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SchistImportBoundary

------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overwrite_mode"

overwrite
------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="one.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./one.md
------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="two.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./two.md
------SchistImportBoundary--

#############################################
### Error cases
#############################################

### No files provided
POST {{apiUrl}}/import/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SchistImportBoundary

------SchistImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="target_path"

/imported
------SchistImportBoundary--
